---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="section welcome">
  <div class="container welcome__grid">
    <div class="welcome__collage">
      <div class="welcome__photo welcome__photo--main">
        <img src={`${base}images/gallery/equipo-centro-buceo.jpeg`} alt="Equipo de instructores de Freediving Litoral" />
      </div>
      <div class="welcome__photo welcome__photo--accent">
        <img src={`${base}images/gallery/entrenamiento-nocturno-monoaletas.jpeg`} alt="Instructor guiando a alumnos con monoaleta" />
      </div>
      <svg class="welcome__shape welcome__shape--wave" viewBox="0 0 120 40" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M0 20 Q 15 5, 30 20 T 60 20 T 90 20 T 120 20" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-blue-400)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="welcome__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--script">¡Hola!</p>
      <h2>Bienvenidos a Freediving Litoral</h2>
      <p>
        Somos una escuela de apnea habilitada por la FAAS (Federación Argentina de Actividades
        Subacuáticas) para la formación de apneistas. Nos guía Raúl Urquiza, nuestro instructor
        principal certificado en niveles I y II para Freediving Indoor y Outdoor, junto a un
        equipo de instructores de nivel I Indoor.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn--solid" href={`${base}nosotros`}>Nuestro método</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .welcome {
    background: var(--color-blue-100);
  }

  .welcome__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .welcome__collage {
    position: relative;
    padding: 1rem 2rem 2rem 0;
  }

  .welcome__photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .welcome__photo--main {
    max-width: 260px;
  }

  .welcome__photo--main img {
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
  }

  .welcome__photo--accent {
    max-width: 200px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-top: -3rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .welcome__photo--accent img {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
  }

  .welcome__shape {
    position: absolute;
  }

  .welcome__shape--wave {
    width: 90px;
    bottom: -0.5rem;
    left: -0.5rem;
  }

  .welcome__copy h2 {
    margin: 0.3rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .eyebrow--script {
    font-family: "Cinzel", serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 800px) {
    .welcome__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
